@startuml Sum_Ssfm_DID_E0B8
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho

legend top left
    "Sum_Ssfm_DID_E0B8"

**Interfaces Legend**
   //ri140 //: DCM DataServices
   
endlegend

note top of EC
DID E0B8 Handler is responsible to update the internal structure of information needed by DID E0B8 and provide
them in the requested format whenever asked by DCM.
end note

component [SSFM::Sum_Ssfm_DID_E0B8] as EC{
	portin ri140
	[Sum_Ssfm_DID_E0B8]  as E
}

  ri140 -> E



@enduml
